<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10236" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπάθ-εια</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰθ]</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffering instead,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυπεῖ τὸν στερόμενον τῶν ἀγαθῶν ἡ ἀ.
					κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					370a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>opposition, contrast,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γῆς πρὸς τὴν αἰθέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.952d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>counteraction, antipathy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				14.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in Metric,
			of <i>opposed</i> rhythms, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κατ᾽ ἀντιπάθειαν μεῖξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heph.
					14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				1.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>contrary affection,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.5.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ συμπαθειῶν καὶ
			ἀντιπαθειῶν,</span> title of work by Bolus, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βῶλος</span>
			, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
